  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: UN Georgia Thematic Pooled Fund on Civic Space Trust Fund Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening civic engagement and participation in public life on the national level and facilitating citizens&#x2019; access to information through pluralistic media are often seen as major instruments to address problems of democratic backsliding and the need to revitalize societal support for democratic processes and institutions. UN in Georgia will mobilize resources under three distinct funding windows: 1) Enhanced citizens&#x2019; awareness and participation in public life; 2) Enhanced skills, capacities and resilience of civic actors to engage with their communities and to participate in decision making process; 3) Enhanced media environment for public deliberation and evidence informed policy discussions to ensure a systematic and integrated approach to the challenges that civil society faces.</narrative>
  </description>
